flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7629794Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7631446Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7631991Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7632455Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7633880Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7634506Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7634936Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7635651Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7635975Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7636671Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7637497Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7638323Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7638819Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7639052Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7639348Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7639822Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7640182Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7640847Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7641077Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7641316Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7641615Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7642235Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
