flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7644800Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7645293Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T12:35:49.7645827Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
